  "shortDescription": "Show the name of an area or a level with a fade, when the player enters it.",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": [
    "Show the name of an area or a level (with a subtitle, like \"Chapter 1\"), when the player enters it:",
    "it fades in, stays a few seconds and fades out.",
    "",
    "Put it on a UI layer. It is shown when the scene starts, or with the action \"Show a title\", for example when the player enters a new zone.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use area titles in many styles are in the asset store [area titles pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=area-titles-area-titles)."
  ],
